ossus.com — mirrored 2026-08-24 (D33) via mirror_site.py (depth 6) into ossus/. Canonical target www.ossus.com (apex 308-redirects to www). Site = Vercel SSR build of Ossus (YC W26, "Intelligence for cultural institutions"; formerly Librar Labs, raised $6M, announced Jun-Jul 2026 via founder LinkedIn + YC profile + edsheet). AI library OS: core ILS product ("The complete system for a public library") + Librar (schools) + add-on agents. robots.txt allow-all; 22 HTML pages (home, 11 blog articles, author + category indexes, /ils/, /subscribe/), 84 files / 11 MB on disk.

Pages mirrored: index.html (home), blog/index.html, blog/{11 articles}, blog/author/karin-wannerud/index.html, blog/category/{culture,field-notes,institutions}/index.html, ils/index.html, subscribe/index.html, plus _next/static tree (chunks, woff2/variable fonts, librar-logo-black.png, icon.png), brand/ tree (scene-portal.jpg 673,034 B, scene-valley.jpg 817,122 B — the post-24-Aug-2026-00:04Z-deploy canonical re-encodes, md5 a223fcc8… / bb0a8649…; earlier pre-deploy copies 251,816 B/344,630 B were replaced), and orphan old-hash media twins that are 404 on current live (unreferenced spares).

Externals / deviations:
- Fonts/chunks/scenes fully vendored; nav logo + icons self-hosted. Links to social/blog external hosts kept as links only.
- HTML on disk is the crawler's intended rewritten form (absolute→relative URL triage). A content deploy during the mirror cycle (Vercel edge purge ~00:04:20Z 2026-08-24, dpl BhxSQG2ZcZkqBNCmpQcXtY1GRi7S, RSC mark oTfCIQ__fJtxUxfKfcJiK, zero chunk changes) re-encoded the two scene JPGs and touched every page body (~150 B each). The crawler's HTTP/1.1 fetches raced the purge and pinned pre-deploy bytes on every run while identical curl/urllib probes returned fresh — verify assets by byte-compare with live, and never use md5-vs-live on HTML (rewrite slashes make it always differ; all HTML deltas are URL triage, zero content).
- Scenes render via <img> whose src was dropped from the home markup by the deploy (still referenced 17+9 times in style/SVG/other attrs) — captured as background/hero art in bands; live parity confirmed by text 15/15 + pixel/vision.
